43.366" end="02:43.654">into </span><span begin="02:43.654" end="02:44.045">the </span><span begin="02:44.045" end="02:44.694">sea</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.413" end="02:48.014"><span begin="02:45.413" end="02:45.620">Laughing </span><span begin="02:45.620" end="02:45.884">as </span><span begin="02:45.884" end="02:46.190">the </span><span begin="02:46.190" end="02:46.494">waves </span><span begin="02:46.494" end="02:46.748">come </span><span begin="02:46.748" end="02:47.006">rolling </span><span begin="02:47.006" end="02:47.270">to </span><span begin="02:47.270" end="02:47.510">my </span><span begin="02:47.510" end="02:48.014">knees</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.150" end="02:49.581"><span begin="02:48.150" end="02:48.349">What </span><span begin="02:48.349" end="02:48.548">a </span><span begin="02:48.548" end="02:48.749">place </span><span begin="02:48.749" end="02:48.949">to </span><span begin="02:48.949" end="02:49.581">be</span></p></div></body></tt>